    and only 72.16 is consistent with the stated Muslim total of 82.99% — so
    the table figures are kept and the contradictory prose repetition is not
    restated. In Archaeology the sentence "Sidon I, II and III are prehistoric
    sites, while Sidon I is the tell of ancient Sidon starting from the Early
    Bronze Age" names Sidon I twice; only the first clause is kept, since the
    site descriptions below identify Sidon IV as the tell. The Gallery images
    and the Panorama of Sidon from the castle image are not in the front
    matter's image list, so they could not be given image-plan entries; the
